WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.861 --> 00:00:13.089
The friends stared at all the candy wrappers.

2
00:00:13.109 --> 00:00:15.911
"What happened?"

3
00:00:16.311 --> 00:00:17.032
Glen asked.

4
00:00:17.052 --> 00:00:20.194
"It must have been a wild animal."

5
00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:23.056
Ezra pointed to the torn screen.

6
00:00:23.076 --> 00:00:28.300
"I guess the rule about no food in the cabins is a good one."

7
00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:33.021
"I wonder what kind of animal ate the candy," Ivy said.

8
00:00:34.621 --> 00:00:36.322
Just then the Ucks walked in.

9
00:00:36.342 --> 00:00:40.083
"Hey, kid," Huck said to Glen.

10
00:00:40.103 --> 00:00:41.863
"Where's our candy?"

11
00:00:46.284 --> 00:00:47.925
Glen picked up the empty wrappers.

12
00:00:47.945 --> 00:00:53.026
"Uh I'm out of candy right now, but I'll get more tomorrow!"

13
00:00:53.806 --> 00:00:56.067
He smiled and gave the Ucks a thumbs-up.

14
00:00:56.087 --> 00:00:58.188
"They ate it all!"

15
00:00:58.528 --> 00:00:59.208
Chuck yelled.

16
00:01:00.768 --> 00:01:02.850
"We didn't eat it," Ezra said.

17
00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:06.293
"A wild animal broke in and stole it."

18
00:01:10.056 --> 00:01:11.697
He tried to fix the torn screen.

19
00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.302
A sly grin spread across Ivy's face.

20
00:01:17.322 --> 00:01:18.983
"It was a bear.

21
00:01:19.624 --> 00:01:21.245
A huge, brown one!"

22
00:01:22.666 --> 00:01:24.988
The Ucks stared at her and started laughing.

23
00:01:25.008 --> 00:01:27.851
"Yeah, right," Buck said.

24
00:01:29.688 --> 00:01:30.628
"Didn't you see it?"

25
00:01:31.089 --> 00:01:31.709
Ivy asked.

26
00:01:31.729 --> 00:01:35.270
"It ran out of the cabin and into the woods."

27
00:01:37.991 --> 00:01:39.192
Buck pointed at Glen.

28
00:01:39.212 --> 00:01:41.793
"You'd better have candy for us tomorrow.

29
00:01:42.113 --> 00:01:42.613
Or else!"

30
00:01:42.633 --> 00:01:45.034
"A bear!"

31
00:01:45.374 --> 00:01:45.975
Huck said.

32
00:01:45.995 --> 00:01:48.396
"Who would believe a story like that?"

33
00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.517
The Ucks walked away, still laughing.

34
00:01:54.578 --> 00:01:55.599
Ivy ran to the door.

35
00:01:55.619 --> 00:01:58.720
"You'll make good bear food!"

36
00:01:59.132 --> 00:01:59.653
she yelled.

37
00:01:59.673 --> 00:02:03.476
"Bears always eat the dumb kids first!"

38
00:02:11.022 --> 00:02:14.645
The next morning after breakfast, the three friends left the mess hall.

39
00:02:18.728 --> 00:02:21.611
need to sneak into the office somehow," Glen said.

40
00:02:21.631 --> 00:02:24.273
"I have to get candy for the Ucks."

41
00:02:25.594 --> 00:02:27.896
He gulped, remembering Buck's threat.

42
00:02:28.884 --> 00:02:29.465
"Or else!"

43
00:02:29.485 --> 00:02:36.149
"I'll help you, but don't let those bullies push you around," Ivy said.

44
00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:38.691
Ezra was quiet.

45
00:02:38.711 --> 00:02:40.212
"What's wrong?"

46
00:02:40.732 --> 00:02:41.333
Ivy asked.

47
00:02:41.353 --> 00:02:45.416
"I miss my parents," Ezra said.

48
00:02:45.436 --> 00:02:49.358
"I really wish I was at the beach with them."

49
00:02:50.419 --> 00:02:51.040
He sighed.

50
00:02:53.982 --> 00:02:55.022
Ivy's eyes lit up.

51
00:02:55.042 --> 00:02:57.124
"Let's go to the office.

52
00:02:58.432 --> 00:03:01.795
You can call your parents, and we'll sneak Glen's candy out somehow."

53
00:03:03.617 --> 00:03:06.299
Ezra smiled, and the three headed to the office.

54
00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:09.942
"Attention, campers!"

55
00:03:10.263 --> 00:03:12.905
Mrs. Matsak's voice came over the PA system.

56
00:03:12.925 --> 00:03:16.208
"Tomorrow Camp Evergreen's owner, Mr.

57
00:03:16.408 --> 00:03:17.830
Offal, will visit.

58
00:03:19.211 --> 00:03:20.712
He has a special gift for us.

59
00:03:21.713 --> 00:03:24.716
Everyone will meet in the square for the big ceremony."

60
00:03:26.476 --> 00:03:29.299
"I bet the gift is the bear statue we saw yesterday."

61
00:03:30.099 --> 00:03:31.040
Glen shook his head.

62
00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:35.304
"Ivy, why did you tell the Ucks that crazy bear story?"

63
00:03:36.965 --> 00:03:37.606
Ivy laughed.

64
00:03:37.626 --> 00:03:41.889
"I was just having fun, trying to scare them."

65
00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.751
They reached the office as Mrs.

66
00:03:44.811 --> 00:03:46.213
Matsak stepped outside.

67
00:03:46.233 --> 00:03:49.235
"Mrs. Matsak?"

68
00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:51.257
Ezra cleared his throat.

69
00:03:51.277 --> 00:03:54.660
"Could I please call my parents?"

70
00:03:56.156 --> 00:03:58.977
"You've called them four times since camp started!"

71
00:03:59.397 --> 00:04:00.537
Mrs. Matsak said.

72
00:04:00.557 --> 00:04:06.039
"But my last call was two weeks ago," Ezra said.

73
00:04:07.459 --> 00:04:08.800
Mrs. Matsak sighed.

74
00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:11.620
"Fine. Keep it short."

75
00:04:13.041 --> 00:04:14.881
Private walked up and saluted Mrs.

76
00:04:14.941 --> 00:04:18.022
Matsak. "Ready for inspection?"

77
00:04:18.382 --> 00:04:19.142
Private asked.

78
00:04:20.623 --> 00:04:24.784
Every morning the two women checked the campers' cabins to make sure they were clean.

79
00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:32.123
As they walked away, Glen and Ivy fist-bumped each other.

80
00:04:32.143 --> 00:04:36.787
"Perfect, we'll have the office to ourselves!"

81
00:04:37.208 --> 00:04:37.848
Glen said.

82
00:04:39.129 --> 00:04:40.290
The kids went inside.

83
00:04:41.852 --> 00:04:43.413
Ezra went to make his phone call.

84
00:04:44.714 --> 00:04:47.737
Glen and Ivy opened the cabinet where the packages were kept.

85
00:04:48.478 --> 00:04:52.721
Glen took down his box, grabbed two brownies, and stuffed them in his mouth.

86
00:04:54.223 --> 00:04:55.264
Ivy grabbed one too.

87
00:04:56.692 --> 00:04:58.653
Then they filled their pockets with candy.

88
00:05:00.374 --> 00:05:03.275
Suddenly Ezra's voice boomed through the loudspeaker.

89
00:05:03.295 --> 00:05:05.917
"But Mommy and Daddy!

90
00:05:05.937 --> 00:05:08.438
I miss you so much!

91
00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:12.240
Don't you miss your Snuggy Wuggy?"

92
00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:15.521
Glen and Ivy stared at each other.

93
00:05:16.702 --> 00:05:20.043
Somehow Ezra's phone call could be heard through the PA system!
